ment preflight\n- [ ] Full pytest coverage campaign\n- [ ] Current public-head `Lint (ruff)` and `Smoke tests`\n- [ ] Complete configured review on this actual public head\n\n# Testing\n\n- Author:25 path cases PASS on Node22.17.1 and24.21.0;3 selected Python LF/actual-autocrlf/portable-generation tests PASS with pytest8.4.1/PyYAML6.0.2; Black/Ruff/syntax/diff checks PASS. The final test-only child reran the3 Python tests; unchanged JavaScript retains the two25-case runs.\n- Independent:25 Node cases, final3 Python cases and the first LF test from an owned source copy without `.git` PASS. A real Git checkout makes the unpinned control physically CRLF while preserving every catalogued raw byte and generated identity. All16 deterministic campaign records remain equal, apart from actual wall-clock receipts and the changed reproducer's expected self-hash.\n- Independent complete source identity:3,771 files/192,993,007 bytes,633 reconstructed trees; exact four-file delta and protected papers/generated/workflow bytes verified. Scoped review SHA256 `a8ac200b0544814863597b2e13b1978a53b057f6d2394ffc3d60bff17e8dbda9`. Author final portable report SHA256 `84a5ba799958428b8de1a4a7dde99773dc3063a2fa5accfd95c9fdec0307c392`.\n- The minimal local interpreter lacks the full project's pip/NumPy/pandas environment; its preflight limitation and initial unavailable-pytest attempts remain recorded. No runtime packages were installed. Native Windows generation, full hosted hooks/browser/native/coverage and actual-main release qualification remain pending.\n\nAddresses [4345508847](https://github.com/MontrealAI/AGI-Alpha-Agent-v0/pull/4851#discussion_r4345508847) and [4345508855](https://github.com/MontrealAI/AGI-Alpha-Agent-v0/pull/4851#discussion_r4345508855) in this proposed source. Original main87 attempt1 producers remain running and retain their own source scope. Existing different-SHA concurrency and exact-current-main publication guards are unchanged. Final companion/browser pins r